lculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Swift County has 75 years on record from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025 the middle ran June to July at 170% of normal and January to February at 28%. So far in 2026, the middle shows April to May at 54% of normal and June to July at 116%. Every grid on the page had its driest year in 1976, with grid 30136 at 38%.</p>"}
